  <p id="c-nanshi-011-wangshaoming:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshaoming:p001:m0000" ref="79g_3gx_htk">海陵王</persName><persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshaoming:p001:m0003" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBAD">王妃</persName>諱<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshaoming:p001:m0006" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBAD">韶明</persName>，琅邪臨沂人，太常<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshaoming:p001:m0017" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBA">慈</persName>之女也。永明八年，納為臨汝公夫人。<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshaoming:p001:m0035" ref="iop_ybd_afm">郁林王</persName>即位，為新安王妃。延興元年，為皇后。其年，降為海陵王妃。妃父<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshaoming:p001:m0068" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBA">慈</persName>自有傳。</p>
</text>
